	"data": "Concept: Year Reflections & Longitudinal Self-Portrait\n\nWhat It Is\ncithoreal periodically records extended \"year in review\" sessions — longitudinal self-portraits that surface patterns invisible in day-to-day journals. The Dec 2023 recording is a particularly rich example.\n\nDec 2023: The Throat Year\n\"This was a throat year. I intended to focus on my throat chakra — gain deeper understandings.\"\n\nKey arc of 2023:\nLeft Infosys (~1.5 years in), returned to college before losing the job\nSignificant…",
